{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1547944-what-s-up-with-siegfried","id":1547944,"title":"What's up with Siegfried?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-01-25T00:17:15-08:00","id":1547944,"title":"What's up with Siegfried?","content":"He's such a nice guy, I haven't heard of him in a long while. Is he still in Vancouver after all that happpened?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12348-herr-meister","name":"Herr Meister","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12348_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-01-26T12:26:12-08:00","id":1547961,"title":"","content":"I personally like to think that he is still Prince of Vancouver and is unaffected by the Beckoning.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-01-26T18:28:21-08:00","id":1547968,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1547944-what-s-up-with-siegfried?p=1547961#post1547961\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I personally like to think that he is still Prince of Vancouver and is unaffected by the Beckoning.</div> </div> </div> </div>I also like to think that, he's so damn cool, I hope he keeps being cool. Hahaha","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12348-herr-meister","name":"Herr Meister","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12348_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-01-27T07:48:36-08:00","id":1547976,"title":"","content":"The latest &quot;news&quot; that I've picked up about Siegfried is less news, but rather backstory, in the form of a character named <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Misery\" target=\"_blank\">Misery</a> from &quot;Children of the Blood&quot;.<br /> <br /> Apparently, he:<br /> <br /> 1) Knows/knew Marcus Vitel.<br /> <br /> 2) Is a bit of a playboy.<br /> <br /> It was an... interesting?... choice. But I don't think they've put out any new information on him in 5th Edition otherwise. The whole Vancouver setting seems to be one that they mostly wanted to move on from.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25886-kharnov","name":"Kharnov","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"683"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-01-27T08:39:01-08:00","id":1547978,"title":"","content":"&quot;We want to move away from the idea of a powerful Prince establishing a sect-free city, even if it's happening in a somewhat out of the way location. Also, here is an even more ludicrously powerful Prince establishing a sect-free region over the entire Mid-Atlantic.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude02","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6350-marcusvitel","name":"MarcusVitel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-01-27T09:03:22-08:00","id":1547979,"title":"","content":"I think what they didn\u2019t like about Vancouver was the cooperation between Kindred and Garou.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-01-27T09:31:11-08:00","id":1547980,"title":"","content":"Well he\u2019s very tall, he\u2019s very brave and he\u2019s not the brightest light at the funeral pyre when it comes to avoiding Legendary Doom.<br /> <br /> \u2026<br /> <br /> Whoops, wrong Siegfried.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28339-atticus-cleanclaw","name":"Atticus Cleanclaw","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"638"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-01-27T11:02:07-08:00","id":1547982,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amethyst</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1547944-what-s-up-with-siegfried?p=1547979#post1547979\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think what they didn\u2019t like about Vancouver was the cooperation between Kindred and Garou.</div> </div> </div> </div>And I call it BS, because it's exactly the fact that the city is so different that makes it appealing in the first place, I had players love it exactly because it provides a different and unique setting.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> &quot;We want to move away from the idea of a powerful Prince establishing a sect-free city, even if it's happening in a somewhat out of the way location. Also, here is an even more ludicrously powerful Prince establishing a sect-free region over the entire Mid-Atlantic.&quot; </div> </div> </div>Yah, pretty much that lol...<br /> <br /> One thing I need to add that I didn't like about the setting is some choices for names, like &quot;Stalest Coursain&quot;, I mean wtf, this isn't a real name and it feels so weird...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12348,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12348-herr-meister","user":"Herr Meister","date":". 01-27-2025, 08:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12348-herr-meister","name":"Herr Meister","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12348_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-01-27T17:30:15-08:00","id":1547989,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Herr Meister</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1547944-what-s-up-with-siegfried?p=1547982#post1547982\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> And I call it BS, because it's exactly the fact that the city is so different that makes it appealing in the first place, I had players love it exactly because it provides a different and unique setting.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Yah, pretty much that lol...<br /> <br /> One thing I need to add that I didn't like about the setting is some choices for names, like &quot;Stales Coursain&quot;, I mean wtf, this isn't a real name and it feels so weird...</div> </div> </div> </div>I agree with you. I read Dark Alliance: Vancouver and I thought it was a really cool setting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-01-28T11:45:29-08:00","id":1548005,"title":"","content":"Very good, very good indeed!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12348-herr-meister","name":"Herr Meister","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12348_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-01-28T15:27:14-08:00","id":1548010,"title":"","content":"Dark Alliance made for an interesting new take on the game setting where you had a tense cease fire between the kindred and lupines and you had a powerful Ventrue Prince who didn't follow clan protocol or sect politics and forged his own path and you would think that younger clan members would find that appealing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-01-28T16:37:56-08:00","id":1548011,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1547944-what-s-up-with-siegfried?p=1548010#post1548010\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Dark Alliance made for an interesting new take on the game setting where you had a tense cease fire between the kindred and lupines and you had a powerful Ventrue Prince who didn't follow clan protocol or sect politics and forged his own path and you would think that younger clan members would find that appealing.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, yes, also it's good that he isnt anarch, if it was in V5 they would probably make him a Baron and Vancouver anarch. I still don't buy much the whole &quot;anarchs are suddenly mor powerful than the Sabbat&quot; in V5. In fact, I have a good deal of troubles with the changes to the setting in V5.Still, I enjoyed a lot this recent game <i>Parliament of Knives</i>, very fun to play.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12348-herr-meister","name":"Herr Meister","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12348_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-01-28T16:38:39-08:00","id":1548012,"title":"","content":"Still that's on a sidenote, I still want to talk about Siegfried and not Arundel hahaha","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12348-herr-meister","name":"Herr Meister","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12348_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-01-30T11:39:28-08:00","id":1548061,"title":"","content":"Siegrfried is no anarch for sure and he wouldn't tolerate them at all in his domain and he keeps the Brujah under tight control and he isn't fond of the Malkavians and I bet he feels the same way about the Followers of Set/Ministry.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-02-02T16:58:50-08:00","id":1548121,"title":"","content":"Since we are on the subject of Siegfried and Vancouver, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1359177-vancouver-20th-anniversary-edition?p=1359298#post1359298\">here</a>'s a little something that might be amenable to the thread's interests.<br /> <br /> (It has been 5 years already? oh boy...)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-02-03T19:57:52-08:00","id":1548173,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1547944-what-s-up-with-siegfried?p=1548121#post1548121\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Since we are on the subject of Siegfried and Vancouver, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1359177-vancouver-20th-anniversary-edition?p=1359298#post1359298\">here</a>'s a little something that might be amenable to the thread's interests.<br /> <br /> (It has been 5 years already? oh boy...)</div> </div> </div> </div>That's in fact a very interesting thread. Thanks for that!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12348-herr-meister","name":"Herr Meister","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12348_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-02-04T01:29:26-08:00","id":1548178,"title":"","content":"I forgot about that thread and some of the good ideas of updating the lore.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-02-04T05:18:54-08:00","id":1548182,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Herr Meister</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1547944-what-s-up-with-siegfried?p=1548173#post1548173\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's in fact a very interesting thread. Thanks for that!</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks. Though Kharnov &amp; me had quite diverging interests and priorities on the subject of a game set in the city, the resulting back-&amp;-forth of questions, possible answers and ideas led us to explore quite a bit of angles, little forgotten morsels and our own takes and additions to many elements of Vancouver as a base for a coterie to immerse and get itself in trouble on, to which a number of very inspired people would bring obscure lore references, suggestions and additional crossover bits and hooks of their own. Still quite fond of the end result.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-02-04T10:43:07-08:00","id":1548190,"title":"","content":"I liked the idea that there's no slumbering Methuselah in Vancouver and it's a plot by Sigfried and Lyle to keep up the status quo. Or that he probably does have under the radar deals with the Camarilla leadership for certain considerations.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-02-04T11:38:43-08:00","id":1548195,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1547944-what-s-up-with-siegfried?p=1548190#post1548190\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I liked the idea that there's no slumbering Methuselah in Vancouver and it's a plot by Sigfried and Lyle to keep up the status quo. Or that he probably does have under the radar deals with the Camarilla leadership for certain considerations.</div> </div> </div> </div>Any comments on my joke idea of Lyle and Kyle Forbenson being &quot;different&quot; (book uses <i>exactly the same picture</i> for both - though the wiki adopted that of one of the archetypes from Clanbook: Gangrel for Kyle) guises of the same elusive methuselah, that is actually just chilling out? Or his misguided crush-inspired attempt to prop Stalest into Siegfried's place leading her into a histeric bender of paranoia and countermoves? Or Yokoshi the Hit Mark? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-02-04T12:28:18-08:00","id":1548197,"title":"","content":"If we have a game in Vancouver, I'm thinking that Stalest is gone via the Beckoning.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-02-04T13:45:07-08:00","id":1548202,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1547944-what-s-up-with-siegfried?p=1548197#post1548197\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If we have a game in Vancouver, I'm thinking that Stalest is gone via the Beckoning.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's a quick way to cut on undesired NPCs in numbers for certain - though for me it's hard to make a solid argument for why she would go but Lyle and Siegfried (or Necross) remain mostly unaffected.<br /> <br /> Personally, i have something of a soft spot for the mess of clashing concepts that go into Stalest backstory, stats &amp; etc. The fact she has History at the same as Politics did inspire me to reimagine her as a socialite-historian of sorts in the vein of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Livy\" target=\"_blank\">Livy</a> instead of the typical Ventrue plotting for praxis. Also, possibly a secret Caitiff and a high-ranking member of the Servitors of Irad (my own peculiar take of them, at least).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-02-04T18:07:20-08:00","id":1548212,"title":"","content":"With Necross the Beckoning doesn't bother him because I would go with Malkav essentially being the Madness Network and doesn't have a physical form anymore.<br /> <br /> As for the two Ventrue we would go with the idea that their antideuvlian has no reason to judge them. But that how we are playing the Beckoning in our game as some elders and ancients are being called away with some returning with greater power or being much weaker than before.<br /> <br /> However that is our game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-02-05T08:44:36-08:00","id":1548223,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1547944-what-s-up-with-siegfried?p=1548182#post1548182\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks. Though Kharnov &amp; me had quite diverging interests and priorities on the subject of a game set in the city, the resulting back-&amp;-forth of questions, possible answers and ideas led us to explore quite a bit of angles, little forgotten morsels and our own takes and additions to many elements of Vancouver as a base for a coterie to immerse and get itself in trouble on, to which a number of very inspired people would bring obscure lore references, suggestions and additional crossover bits and hooks of their own. Still quite fond of the end result.</div> </div> </div> </div>It was a very interesting thread! I have definitely come around to some of the ideas that you suggested, though still of a different mind about other things. Glad to hear that other people enjoyed the thread as well! I haven't updated it in a while because my ideas have mostly just been sitting on the back-burner, being idly pondered rather than moving in concrete directions. But I may make a post sharing my latest ideas some time soon. It's been a while since I've looked at the thread, tbh, so I'll need to remind myself what the last update was about, haha.<br /> <br /> The whole thing with Misery that I posted about above actually got me wondering two things about Siegfried:<br /> <br /> 1) His relationship with Julie Foster. Off the top of my head, I can't remember if the text actually comes out and says whether or not they're lovers. But whether or not they are, how does Siegfried having a thing for picking up fiery young women every few decades or so affect their relationship? It is pretty clear about the fact that Julie is in love with him, so I wonder how she might respond to such things.<br /> <br /> 2) Siegfried's childer. I don't think any previous sources really explore the idea, but a vampire as old as him has probably Embraced at least a few people over the centuries. Misery's story gives us at least one &quot;type&quot; of relationship he would have with potential childer, but I also figure that he'd be likely to Embrace warrior-types, more like himself, with a more utilitarian attitude towards their potential uses.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25886-kharnov","name":"Kharnov","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"683"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-02-05T09:55:13-08:00","id":1548227,"title":"","content":"I'm sure that Siegfried has at least a couple of childer hanging around in the World of Darkness that are at least of elder age. I would think as Prince that he sired at least once. In regards to his relationship with Julie Foster I don't think that their lovers at all.<br /> <br /> I'm sure that the Tremere would love for that to happen, but I don't think that the Prince has such feelings for her and sees her as a very useful assest and near equal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":27361,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","user":"Lysander","date":". 02-05-2025, 02:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-02-05T11:33:55-08:00","id":1548231,"title":"","content":"It's also possible that Siegfried has no childer whatsoever due to his trouble dealing with his kindred nature and not wanting to subject someone else to the same curse as his writeup says he still retains a fair amount of his compassion from his living days.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-02-05T15:05:48-08:00","id":1548237,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1547944-what-s-up-with-siegfried?p=1548227#post1548227\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm sure that Siegfried has at least a couple of childer hanging around in the World of Darkness that are at least of elder age. I would think as Prince that he sired at least once. In regards to his relationship with Julie Foster I don't think that their lovers at all.<br /> <br /> I'm sure that the Tremere would love for that to happen, but I don't think that the Prince has such feelings for her and sees her as a very useful assest and near equal.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'll need to double-check &quot;DA: Vancouver&quot; and &quot;Technocracy: Syndicate&quot; again, since those are the sources where Julie is mentioned. I'm fairly sure that they explicitly mention Julie not having any formal ties with the rest of the Tremere Clan, so they don't really gain much from whatever her relationship with Siegfried might be.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1547944-what-s-up-with-siegfried?p=1548231#post1548231\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's also possible that Siegfried has no childer whatsoever due to his trouble dealing with his kindred nature and not wanting to subject someone else to the same curse as his writeup says he still retains a fair amount of his compassion from his living days.</div> </div> </div> </div>That interpretation mostly makes sense, especially considering his own response to the Embrace. But that's precisely why the whole thing with Misery got me thinking, because it explicitly describes him intending to Embrace her. It also doesn't jive with him having a law against Embracing people within Vancouver; he doesn't come across as the sort to make a law, then break it himself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25886-kharnov","name":"Kharnov","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"683"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-02-05T15:13:13-08:00","id":1548238,"title":"","content":"Yes Julie Foster is on the outs with her clan and was saved by the future Ventrue Prince and feels gratitude to towards him.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}